{
  "description": "Mobile 390x844 portrait, DPR 3, touch, R-08, R-09 and R-33: the long press. Runs right after 09 on an empty canvas. Holds one finger still for 800 ms on empty canvas at (200,560), then saves the ARIA, a capture and the app state, and presses Escape. Draws a rectangle [120,330,120,90], deselects it with a tap at (330,640), and holds on its left stroke at (120,375) the same way, reading the scene too; then selects it with a tap there and holds again. A local fixture run found that this headless Chromium fires no contextmenu for a held touch, so a menu shows only if the page times the press itself. It picks no menu item, types nothing and follows no link.",
